# switch-t210: ureadahead-corruption-check has
#   start on starting boot-complete and stopped ureadahead
# We disable ureadahead (see ureadahead.override), so it never runs and
# never emits 'stopped ureadahead'.  upstart holds the 'starting
# boot-complete' event against the unresolved 'and' operator forever,
# wedging boot-complete in the 'starting' state -> system-services
# (and thus dns-proxy, DNS, OOBE) never start.
#
# The check only validates ureadahead's pack file, which doesn't exist
# when ureadahead is off, so it has nothing to do anyway.  Disabling it
# removes the reference and lets boot-complete finish.
manual
